    "title_en": "What we talk about when we talk about nuclear structure",
    "abstract_en": "I provide and introductory overview of the field of nuclear structure, with a focus on physical concepts. I describe some basic nuclear structure observables, followed by a qualitative description of nuclear forces. I then outline some nuclear structure models which are most widely used to interpret the experimental data in terms of interacting protons and neutrons.",
